Depends: ${misc:Depends}, secubox-core (>= 1.0), python3, python3-uvicorn | python3-pip, python3-httpx | python3-pip
Description: ZIA Hall — local ARM64 AI, interface to the Hall object bus (POC)
 ZIA is AletheiaVox/SBXOS's local AI: the human interface to the Hall's object bus.
 It does not own the data — it interprets and orchestrates objects already exposed
 by SecuBox (the bus stays the source of truth and applies the ACL). Always local
 (level 1); delegates to a VHOST (level 2) or optional remote (level 3) when needed.
 .
 POC / P1: FastAPI on a Unix socket (/api/v1/zia/), a heuristic responder that calls
 read-first bus tools (search_objects, get_object, list_recent, open, delegate) so it
 never invents an object, plus a Chat cardlet for the Hall. A llama.cpp GGUF model
 (chosen after benchmark on the MOCHAbin) plugs into the same interface later.
